 by her assailant to steal her position at court, Reirin's plight seems dire... to everyone else! Now that she's got a robust new body, not even the looming threat of execution can stop her!","year":2020,"status":"ongoing","lastChapter":null,"contentRating":"safe","tags":["Romance","Drama","Fantasy","Mystery"],"poster":"https://uploads.mangadex.org/covers/818d037d-2629-40ad-bdcc-09cf19f510d3/deb12614-39b9-4909-a5bb-322232a8cbe0.jpg.512.jpg","originalLanguage":"ja","availableLanguages":["pt-br","it","es-la","en"],"lane":"manga","rating":8.91,"follows":10115,"listAt":"2026-10-19T10:35:27.411Z","chapters":[{"id":"8eb83e99-d6b6-4f82-9354-eb57e8c5b0b8","number":"2","volume":"1","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":28,"createdAt":"2021-03-09T20:45:17+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"ec4242f0-70fa-4716-b32f-362405c43761","number":"1","volume":"1","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":36,"createdAt":"2021-01-09T06:41:27+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":2,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-19T10:29:04.226Z"}}
